  "title": "Unified title",
  "summary": "This study presents a comprehensive evaluation of in-context learning and retrieval strategies for Devanagari post-OCR correction, using large language models (LLMs) and character-based BM25 retrieval. The results show that CharBM25 outperforms traditional retrieval methods, achieving high accuracy across Hindi and Marathi benchmarks.\n\nTeam RAS in the 11th ABAW Competition presents a multimodal approach for recognizing ambivalence and hesitancy, combining linguistic, acoustic, facial, and scene features using text-centered fusion models. The Text Residual Fusion model achieves high performance across different subsets of the BAH corpus.",
